<p>This page is a compilation of my anime/manga reviews; it is compiled from my <a href="https://myanimelist.net/profile/gwern" id="_Ivj1vSP1" data-link-icon="MAL" data-link-icon-type="text,tri,sans" data-link-icon-color="#2b498e" title="gwern&#39;s Profile">MyAnimeList</a> account &amp; <a href="/doc/newsletter/index" id="_Si8unX4J" class="prefetch-not link-annotated link-page" data-filesize-bytes="24828" data-filesize-percentage="32" title="‘newsletter’ directory">newsletter</a>. Reviews are sorted by rating in descending order.</p>
<p>See also my <a href="/review/book" id="gwern-review-book" class="prefetch-not link-annotated link-page backlink-not" data-filesize-bytes="1013195" data-filesize-percentage="98" title="&#39;Book Reviews&#39;, Gwern 2013">book</a>, <a href="/review/movie" id="gwern-review-movie" class="prefetch-not link-annotated link-page backlink-not" data-filesize-bytes="216878" data-filesize-percentage="77" title="&#39;Movie Reviews&#39;, Gwern 2014">film/TV</a>, &amp; <a href="/review/opera" id="gwern-review-opera" class="prefetch-not link-annotated link-page backlink-not" data-filesize-bytes="100983" data-filesize-percentage="59" title="&#39;Opera Reviews&#39;, Gwern 2019">opera reviews</a>.</p>
